'''Ubialla Gheal''' was a [[Gender|female]] who owned a [[Ubialla Gheal's nightclub|club]] in the city [[Canto Bight]] on the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]].<ref name="Wine in Dreams" /> Ubailla often did favors for the city's elites, so that she could rise in Canto Bight's social hierarchy.<ref name="DB" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Gheal appeared in the [[2017]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']].<ref name="TLJ" />

